romdev-spimdisasm
=================

This package is a JavaScript port of spimdisasm, the MIPS disassembler used by
splat, made for romdev.

Components and attribution
--------------------------

1. spimdisasm
   https://github.com/Decompollaborate/spimdisasm
   Copyright (c) 2022 Decompollaborate.
   Licensed under the MIT License (LICENSE).
   src/common/, src/mips/ and src/elf32/ are module-by-module translations of
   the spimdisasm Python package. The port reproduces these releases,
   selected at runtime with configureVersion():
     1.42.4  4b5d4c68eeb9f9eae14b3bb713971433ae2c3c43 (base)
     1.39.3  c4737d9266fe626c130823b3c21c60f1209f39fa
     1.35.0  cc2104b561c6b4468441862de7dec7140fad052f
   The command line frontends (disasmdis, rspDisasm, elfObjDisasm,
   singleFileDisasm, frontendCommon) and the argparse wiring are not ported.

2. CPython codec tables and algorithms (src/py/cjk-tables-jp.js,
   src/py/codecs.js, test/data/cjk-encmap-jp.js)
   https://github.com/python/cpython
   The Japanese decode maps are generated by scripts/gen-cjk-tables.mjs from
   CPython 3.13 Modules/cjkcodecs/mappings_jp.h; the decoders follow
   Modules/cjkcodecs/_codecs_jp.c and multibytecodec.c. The float formatting
   (src/py/pyfloat.js) and set iteration order (src/py/pyset.js) follow
   CPython's Python/pystrtod.c, Objects/floatobject.c and Objects/setobject.c.
   Copyright (c) 2001 Python Software Foundation; All Rights Reserved.
   Licensed under the Python Software Foundation License Version 2 (PSF-2.0).

3. rabbitizer
   Not contained in this package: romdev-spimdisasm depends on the separate
   romdev-rabbitizer package (MIT, Decompollaborate), and activates the
   rabbitizer release paired with the selected spimdisasm release
   (1.42.4 with 1.16.2, 1.39.3 with 1.14.3, 1.35.0 with 1.13.0).

